      "forward_horizon_days": 10
    },
    "regime_notes": "Inverse orientation was used after the signed candidate produced IC -0.042136 and ICIR -0.153536. Inverse results pass benchmark gates across the full sample; signed IC was negative in 2024-26, 2027-29, 2030-32 and 2032-33. Uncertainty is interpreted conservatively because the cross-section is 15 assets.",
